 8. 💰 1 film thing: Spidey swings past $2B 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: Box Office Mojo , Variety . Chart: Shane Savitsky/Axios Eight films have now made more than $2 billion worldwide, after "Spider-Man: Brand New Day" broke the historic mark in only its third weekend, Variety reports . 

 🤯 What's next: Analysts are watching whether "Spider-Man: Brand New Day" could become the first movie to crack $3 billion globally and $1 billion domestically. It's at $785 million. "Star Wars: The Force Awakens" leads with $946 million. Go deeper . 

 
 
